name:Oratio I Præsta (alone: the 2nd and 3rd prayers come after the second Collect);
office-part:Oratio;
occasion:Feria IV Hebdomadæ Sanctæ (Missale O.P. 1939, p. 154);
book:set to the Dominican tone of the Orations at Vespers, Lauds and Mass, Processionarium O.P. (1913), pp. 404-406 (pdf = printed + 16); text from the Missale O.P. (1939), p. 154;
commentary:Proc. p. 404, II. The Missal prints "Secunda et tertia Oratio" only after the second Collect: this one keeps its conclusion.;
